{"name":"Laguna","hex":"#36a5c9","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Laguna","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of or pertaining to the Laguna Pueblo people, culture, or the variety of Keres they speak."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A federally recognized tribe of Keres-speaking Pueblo people in Cibola County, New Mexico.","A member of this tribe."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Laguna"}],"entries":[{"title":"Ana Laguna","blocks":[{"text":"Ana Laguna is a Spanish-Swedish ballet dancer, court dancer and professor. She has danced throughout the world with such legends as Rudolf Nureyev and Mikhail Baryshnikov earning prizes for her performances from France, Italy, Monaco, Russia, Spain, Sweden and the United States."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Ana_Laguna.jpg/330px-Ana_Laguna.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ana_Laguna"},{"title":"Laguna (province)","blocks":[{"text":"Laguna, officially the Province of Laguna, is a province in the Philippines located in the Calabarzon region in Luzon. Its capital is Santa Cruz while its largest city is Biñan. The province is situated southeast of Metro Manila, south of the province of Rizal, west of Quezon, north of Batangas and east of Cavite. Laguna straddles the southern shores of Laguna de Bay, the largest lake in the country. As of the 2024 census, the total population of Laguna is 3,687,345. Among all 82 provinces in the Philippines, Laguna accounted for the largest share (5%) of the national Gross Domestic Product (GDP) with a total of Php 990.69 billion in 2022."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3b/Laguna_Provincial_Capitol%2C_Dec_2023_%281%29.jpg/330px-Laguna_Provincial_Capitol%2C_Dec_2023_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laguna_(province)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Ana_Laguna.jpg/500px-Ana_Laguna.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Ana_Laguna.jpg/1280px-Ana_Laguna.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Ana_Laguna.jpg/500px-Ana_Laguna.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAna_Laguna.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3b/Laguna_Provincial_Capitol%2C_Dec_2023_%281%29.jpg/500px-Laguna_Provincial_Capitol%2C_Dec_2023_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3b/Laguna_Provincial_Capitol%2C_Dec_2023_%281%29.jpg/1280px-Laguna_Provincial_Capitol%2C_Dec_2023_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3b/Laguna_Provincial_Capitol%2C_Dec_2023_%281%29.jpg/500px-Laguna_Provincial_Capitol%2C_Dec_2023_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALaguna_Provincial_Capitol%2C_Dec_2023_(1).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Paete_Church%2C_Laguna%2C_December_2023_%282%29.jpg/500px-Paete_Church%2C_Laguna%2C_December_2023_%282%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Paete_Church%2C_Laguna%2C_December_2023_%282%29.jpg/1280px-Paete_Church%2C_Laguna%2C_December_2023_%282%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Paete_Chur